1.1 Which version is installed
==============================

‘M-x bookmark-gt-version’ displays the installed version followed by the
Emacs version in parentheses — the line to include in a bug report.
With a prefix argument (‘C-u M-x bookmark-gt-version’) the same text is
inserted at point, so it can be pasted into an issue without retyping.
From Lisp the function returns the bare version string, the value of the
‘bookmark-gt-version’ variable.


